  "description": "Binary search on the answer: monotone predicate design, minimise-max and maximise-min (Koko, ship packages, split array, aggressive cows, bouquets), k-th smallest by counting in a sorted matrix, and the median of two sorted arrays, with steppers and Go, C++, Java and Python templates.",
  "hero": {
