      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\r\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">50 min</span><span class=\"chip\">Deep dive</span><span class=\"chip\">Monotone predicate</span><span class=\"chip\">O(n log range)</span></div>\r\n  <h1>Binary search on the answer</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lead\">When the question is \"what is the smallest X that is enough?\" or \"the largest X that is still possible?\", stop searching the array and search the answers. Design the yes/no check, prove it is monotone, and reuse one loop for Koko, ship packages, split array, aggressive cows, bouquets, the k-th smallest by counting, and the median of two sorted arrays. Templates in Go, C++, Java and Python.</p>\r\n"
